{"id": "60400", "title": "逃之遥遥", "author": "C西溪C", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60400.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／其他／一般言情／轻松\r\n\r\n关键字：米遥 　易南川 　其他 \r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n米遥知道全天下敢当易南川的逃婚新娘的人只有她一个了，\r\n她也知道高傲如他，一定不会原谅她。刚好，这就是她想要的。\r\n\r\n易南川知道这世上只有一个女人敢这样践踏他的底线，\r\n可她却不知道，他的底线就是她。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60400", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "8865322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-15", "file": "8865324.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-22", "file": "8865325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-28", "file": "8865326.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-35", "file": "8865327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-42", "file": "8865328.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-50", "file": "8865329.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-58", "file": "8865331.html", "available": false}, {"title": "59-63完结", "file": "8865334.html", "available": false}]}